  "body": "Nestled in one of Auckland’s most sought-after coastal suburbs, this beautifully presented three-bedroom home offers the ideal balance of comfort, convenience, and easy-care living, perfect for downsizers and those with young school-aged children. Spread across two levels, the home features double internal-access garaging on the ground floor, with a nook for an office or playroom, while the upper level is dedicated to everyday family life. Upstairs you will find three well-appointed bedrooms, complemented by a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area that forms the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nA courtyard extends the living outdoors, creating an easy setting for weekend barbecues, entertaining friends, or providing a safe and secure space for children to play.\r\nThis property is especially appealing for buyers looking for a lock-up-and-go lifestyle. With a practical layout and low-maintenance living, it offers peace of mind and convenience for those who want to come and go with ease.\r\n\r\nThe home is also next to a joining walkway that provides a direct route into Kohimarama School (Year 1 to Year 8).\r\nKohimarama Beach, local cafés, parks, and village amenities are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\n*The vendors have a registered valuation that is above the listed price. Contact me for further information.\r\n\r\nVisit the open homes or contact me to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nConjunctionals Welcome",
